{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is still in development.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive with your friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.poster.avif?t=1768964085\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.webm?t=1768964085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.mp4?t=1768964085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde Arena is an intense survival game where you must withstand endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic character and choose from four unique classes to shape your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money by defeating enemies, then use it to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase stat-enhancing items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has two powerful final evolutions\u2014choose wisely and dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During break time between waves, spin the roulette and test your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and may you survive the horde!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561610?t=1768964085","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561610?t=1768964085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/e95d85374029e901af2c1b3f1f91f324b0efe037/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768964085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/e95d85374029e901af2c1b3f1f91f324b0efe037/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768964085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Horde Arena features intense combat with blood effects. Future updates may enhance gore effects, including more detailed damage to enemies."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is still in development.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive with your friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.poster.avif?t=1768964085\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.webm?t=1768964085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.mp4?t=1768964085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde Arena is an intense survival game where you must withstand endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic character and choose from four unique classes to shape your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money by defeating enemies, then use it to:</p><ul cl